{"strings": [
{"key": "data.lesson.first_market.say.1", "text": "進貨要精不要多。新店擺滿一整架，只是讓錢站著不動。", "src": "Buy narrow. A wide shelf on a new bar is just money standing still."},
{"key": "data.lesson.first_night.say.0", "text": "六瓶酒加一個酒桶。嚴格說起來，這也算酒吧。", "src": "Six bottles and a keg. That is a bar, technically."},
{"key": "data.lesson.first_night.say.1", "text": "倒酒之前先看人 — 酒客證上寫著他們來喝什麼。", "src": "Read them before you pour — the licence says what they came for."},
{"key": "data.lesson.red_night.say.0", "text": "收銀機裡的錢不夠付房租。每家店都會碰上一次。", "src": "The till is under the rent. It happens to every room once."},
{"key": "data.lesson.red_night.say.1", "text": "兩次就是習慣了。三次，這裡就是另一間掛著你名字的酒吧。", "src": "Twice is a habit. Three times is a different bar with your name on it."},
{"key": "data.lesson.two_spirits.say.0", "text": "兩種烈酒裝進同一個雪克杯，不會自己變成一杯酒。", "src": "Two spirits in one tin do not become a drink on their own."},
{"key": "data.lesson.two_spirits.say.1", "text": "搖盪還是攪拌，酒譜上都寫了。", "src": "Shake it or stir it. The book says which."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.ask.0", "text": "門關了。倒一杯給我吧，店裡真的有的就好。", "src": "Door is shut. Pour me one of whatever we actually have."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.ask.1", "text": "老闆開張第一晚。總有哪裡有這條規矩。", "src": "Owner's first night. It is a rule somewhere."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.declined.0", "text": "你居然拒絕調酒師。膽子不小喔。", "src": "You are turning down the bartender. Bold."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.nudge.0", "text": "架上隨便哪瓶都行。我又不是難搞的那個。", "src": "Anything on that shelf. I am not the difficult one."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_right.0", "text": "上禮拜還不存在的店，調成這樣算不錯了。", "src": "Not bad for a room that did not exist last week."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_right.1", "text": "之後來的客人會幫你算秒數。我不會。", "src": "The ones who come after me will count your seconds. I do not."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_wrong.0", "text": "這不是我點的，而且我已經是最好講話的了。", "src": "That is not what I asked for, and I am the easy one."},
{"key": "hud.closed.banner", "text": "酒吧關門了\n連續虧錢三天 — 按「重新開局」再試一次", "src": "THE BAR IS CLOSED\nthree days losing money — NEW RUN to try again"},
